  "Question": "A class has 50 students. Their ways of traveling to school are: 18 walk, 12 cycle, \\(x\\) take the bus, and 5 use other means. If a student is selected at random, what is the probability that the student takes the bus to school? (Express the result as a fraction in simplest form.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "3/10",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "First find \\(x=50-18-12-5=15\\), so the probability is \\(15/50=3/10\\).",
